  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">IOM Trafficking Macedonia</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">IOM Trafficking Maked.</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">IOM skall arbeta med att identifiera, ta hand om och repatriera tv&#xE5;ngsprostituerade kvinnor i Makedonien. I hemlandet arrangeras mottagning och &#xE5;teranpassnings&#xE5;tg&#xE4;rder. Projektet samarbetar med IOM&apos;s liknande projekt i Kosovo och Albanien.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">IOM will work with identifying, taking care of and repatriating victims of forced prostitution (trafficking) in Macedonia. In their countries of origin reception and reintegration assistance will be provided. The project is co-operating with IOM&apos;s similar projects in Kosovo and Albania.</narrative>
  </description>
